- Notifications.
- Delivery and pickup tracking.
- Reviews and complaints.
- Wishlist and saved designs.
- Privacy and account settings.

### Sewing progress stages

Order received → Measurement confirmed → Fabric selection → Cutting → Sewing → Fitting → Quality inspection → Ready for collection → Delivered.

