## 20. FINAL PRODUCT VISION

Tailorly should become a trusted digital operating platform for tailoring and fashion businesses.

Customers should find it easy to discover tailors, request clothing, order, communicate and follow production.

Shop owners should find it easy to establish their online presence, manage customers, organize production and grow their businesses.

Tailorly must maintain one secure platform while giving each approved shop an independent branded experience.

Build carefully, phase by phase, with excellent user experience, strong security, reliable tenant isolation and maintainable architecture.

**The project owner has final approval over product scope, technology choices and implementation.**